     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reading amounts and dates",
     "texto": [
      "On an invoice, first look for the period, the total **beløp** and the **forfallsdato**. Consumption may appear as measured **forbruk**; a **fastledd** is a fixed charge. Check whether the amount includes taxes and which payment method is requested.",
      "Dates are often written as day.month.year: **15.10.2026**. In figures, Norwegian uses a decimal comma (**1 248,50 kr**). Don't confuse the customer number with the account number."
